**/data/raw/
**/pilot_reporting/raw/
**/pilot_reporting/logs/
**/pilot_reporting/normalized/
**/pilot_reporting/reports/

# Generated business reports / CEO deliverables (proprietary financial data)
artifacts/
exports/
*.xlsx
*.xls

# P11-QUATER — scripts/gold/ is otherwise fully version-controlled (it's
# production code, not generated output), but this one file is real
# product-catalog business data (SKU/EAN/product names) with no Neon
# database authority. It's a local copy needed for scripts/gold/ to run
# on this machine; committing it is a decision for a human, not this
# ignore rule to preempt by omission. See scripts/test_gold_chain_portability.py
# and the P11-QUATER report for the full classification.
scripts/gold/_p5a_keymap.json
